simplesect.para:
The literals, the to_* wrappers, to_t<T>, and the two-argument mt::approx (value, epsilon) are deprecated since 6.0.0. Use instead:

the function comparators mt::eq(), mt::ne(), mt::lt(), mt::le(), mt::gt(), and mt::ge(), which compare and report the plain values;

the function comparator mt::approx (lhs, rhs, epsilon), which sets the tolerance explicitly.
